ing and a valid wait_probe on the two job ids and wait_terminal exit:0, then end the turn without polling. tests/test_one_read_per_trip.py and tests/test_forward_operator_arguments.py stay green; record their base and head arms. Negative control: with the re-freeze disabled the gate fails at 2.37e-6, logged. Status must be exactly complete or blocked; in-progress is not recognised.",
